  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Maya. I've verified your account and checked order #8101 from Saffron Lane.\n\nYou're right that it was very late. It was due at 6:15 PM, but the courier didn't pick it up from the restaurant until 6:40 PM and didn't hand it to you until 7:07 PM. That's 52 minutes late, and I'm sorry your dinner took so long.\n\n**I've added a $15.00 credit to your Forkful account**, and it's ready to use on your next order. For deliveries 45 minutes or more late, the credit is 20% of the subtotal, with a maximum of $15. Your subtotal was $90.00, so 20% would be $18.00, which means the $15 maximum applies. Compensation for late deliveries comes as account credit, not a refund to your card.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for sorting out the credit. That's not really what I was hoping for, though, since it was a long wait and the food was cold by the time it got here.\n\nOh, and while I have you, yesterday's Lotus Garden order (#8102) was missing the pad thai. Everything else was there, but I paid for the pad thai and didn't get it."
  },
